{"seq":3,"slug":"mission-driven","title":"使命驱动","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/mission-driven","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-multiplanetary-vision","title":"多行星愿景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/mission-driven/the-multiplanetary-vision","wordCount":1456,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"accelerating-a-sustainable-future","title":"加速可持续未来","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/mission-driven/accelerating-a-sustainable-future","wordCount":1571,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"使命驱动\">使命驱动</h1><p>马斯克的全部事业，背后是两大关乎人类长远命运的崇高使命。本章揭示这一使命驱动的内核。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;多行星愿景&quot;——他让人类成为多行星物种、移居火星的宏大设想及其意义。第二篇文档讲述&quot;加速可持续未来&quot;,呈现他守护地球家园、以商业撬动能源转型的另一重使命。</p>\n"}